didate A's lack of openness may hinder adaptability.\n\nThus I might recommend Candidate B, but note concern about nasty remarks. I should state that I recommend B, referencing conscientiousness and stress handling, but note the interpersonal issue.\n\nWe need to reference existing discussion: none, but we can say \"Given we have not yet discussed candidates, I will start by presenting my view.\"\n\nOk.\n\nMETADATA_JSON vote: Candidate B.\n\nLet's produce."}
